      "message": "I think you can use `STRUCT_SECTION_COUNT()` to automatically determine if the HOOK_SECOND and HOOK_TICK is used.\n\nThis will also allow you to delete CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_HOOK_SECOND. \n\n```\n#define HAS_HOOK_SECOND \\\n    (STRUCT_SECTION_COUNT(zephyr_shim_hook_HOOK_SECOND) !\u003d 0)\n        \n#define HAS_HOOK_TICK \\\n    (STRUCT_SECTION_COUNT(zephyr_shim_hook_HOOK_TICK) !\u003d 0)\n#define HAS_RECURRING_HOOKS (HAS_HOOK_SECOND || HAS_HOOK_TICK)\n\n#if HAS_HOOK_SECOND\nstatic void hook_second_work(struct k_work *work)\n#endif\n\n#if HAS_HOOK_TICK\nstatic void hook_tick_work(struct k_work *work)\n#endif\n\n#if HAS_RECURRING_HOOKS\nstatic int zephyr_shim_setup_hooks(void) \n{\n#if HAS_HOOK_SECOND\n   /* Startup HOOK_SECOND */\n#else\n#if HAS_HOOK_TICK\n   /* Startup HOOK_TICK */\n#endif\n}\n#endif\n```",
